<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Successful Registration - FEU Diliman</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f6f8;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            color: #333333;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid #e1e4e8;
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #005C3E; /* FEU Green */
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: 5px solid #F1C40F; /* FEU Gold */
        }
        .header h1 {
            color: #ffffff;
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 30px 40px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .content p {
            margin: 0 0 16px;
            font-size: 15px;
        }
        .highlight-box {
            background-color: #f8faf9;
            border-left: 4px solid #005C3E;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 24px 0;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        .highlight-item {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .highlight-item:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }
        .highlight-label {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #666;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 11px;
            display: inline-block;
            width: 140px;
        }
        .highlight-value {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #005C3E;
        }
        .btn-container {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 30px 0 15px;
        }
        .btn {
            background-color: #005C3E;
            color: #ffffff !important;
            padding: 12px 28px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 14px;
            display: inline-block;
            box-shadow: 0 3px 6px rgba(0, 92, 62, 0.2);
            transition: background-color 0.2s;
        }
        .btn:hover {
            background-color: #00462e;
        }
        .link-secondary {
            color: #005C3E;
            text-decoration: underline;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .footer {
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            padding: 20px 40px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #666666;
            border-top: 1px solid #e1e4e8;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>WELCOME TO FEU DILIMAN</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Dear <strong>{{ fullName }}</strong>,</p>
            <p>Congratulations! We are delighted to inform you that your admissions registration at FEU Diliman has been successfully received.</p>
            <p>As a new member of our student body, you are now officially welcomed into the <strong>FEU Diliman Tamaraw community</strong>! We are excited to support you as you embark on this next chapter of your academic journey.</p>
            
            <div class="highlight-box">
                <div class="highlight-item">
                    <span class="highlight-label">Student Name:</span>
                    <span class="highlight-value">{{ fullName }}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="highlight-item">
                    <span class="highlight-label">Student Number:</span>
                    <span class="highlight-value">{{ studentNumber }}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="highlight-item">
                    <span class="highlight-label">Grade Level:</span>
                    <span class="highlight-value">{{ gradeLevel }}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="highlight-item">
                    <span class="highlight-label">School Year:</span>
                    <span class="highlight-value">{{ schoolYear }}</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <p>To begin setting up your credentials and accessing student services, please click the button below to log in to the student portal / solar account:</p>
            
            <div class="btn-container">
                <a href="{{ studentPortalUrl }}" class="btn" target="_blank">Access Student Portal / Solar Account</a>
            </div>

            <p style="margin-top: 25px;">Please make sure to read the <a href="{{ activationGuideUrl }}" class="link-secondary" target="_blank">Activation and Navigation Guide</a> (supplied by ITSO) to help you get started with the portal.</p>
            
            <p style="margin-top: 30px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; padding-top: 20px;">Should you have any questions or require assistance, please feel free to reach out to the Admissions Office.</p>
            <p>Be Brave, Tamaraws!</p>
            <p>Best regards,<br><strong>FEU Diliman Admissions Office</strong></p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; 2026 FEU Diliman Admissions Office. All rights reserved.</p>
            <p>This is an automated notification. Please do not reply directly to this email.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
